{c: Verse 1}
[F]Dekha ek[F]khwab to yeh        [Bb]silsilay hu[F]ye ?
[F]Door tak ni[F]gahon mein hain        [C7]gul khile hu[F]ye.

{c: Verse 1}
[Bb]Yeh gila hai[Bb]aapki        ni[Bb]gahon[Bb]se ?
[C]Phool bhi ho[C]darmiyaan        to[C7]faasle hu[F]ye.

{c: Verse 1}
Meri saanson mein basi[Bb]        khushboo te[Bb]ri.
[Bb]Yeh tere[Bb]pyaar ki        hai[F]jaaduga[F]ri.
[F]Teri aawa[F]z hai        ha[Bb]waaon[Bb]mein.
[Bb]Pyaar ka[Bb]rang hai        fi[F]zaaon[F]mein.
[Bb]Dhadkanon mein[Bb]tere geet        [C]hain mile hu[C]ye.
[F]Kya kahun ke[F]sharm se hain        [C7]lub sile hu[F]ye.
[F]Dekha ek[F]khwab to yeh        [Bb]silsilay hu[F]ye ?
[F]Phool bhi ho[F]darmiyaan to        [C7]faasle hu[F]ye.

{c: Verse 1}
] Mera dil hai teri pa[Bb]        naahon[Bb]mein.
[Bb]Aa chhupa[Bb]loon tujhe        main[F]baahon[F]mein.
[F]Teri tas[F]weer hai        nig[Bb]aahon[Bb]mein.
[Bb]Door tak[Bb]roshni hai        [F]raahon[F]mein.
[F]Kal agar na[F]roshni ke        [Bb]kaafile hu[F]ye.
